{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider"]]},"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/TokensProvider-Implementations"},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"TokensProvider Implementations"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemequantityinputcomponenttokensprovider\/tokensprovider-implementations"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"title":"Theme Orange","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","abstract":[{"text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider/checkInstances(count:for:)":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeQuantityInputComponentTokensProvider\/checkInstances(count:for:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/oranget